# Large Assets (Models should usually be mounted or downloaded, but excluding base folder if not baked)
# Commenting out models exclusion as per original Dockerfile behavior 
# which seemed to expect models usage (though volumes are better).
# If models are baked in:
# !models/
# If models are mounted:
# models/
